<title>USA: Mark Twain Bancshares Inc starts on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Mark Twain Bancshares Inc starts on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mark Twain Bancshares Inc said Thursday it began trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The stock closed unchanged at 40-3/4 on 14,900 shares traded.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
